      "name": "X-Men Core Reading Order: Silver Age to Claremont",
      "description": "X-Men: First Class revisits the original team's beginnings before Giant-Size X-Men brings a new team together. Chris Claremont's years follow through Phoenix, Dark Phoenix, the Brood, Days of Future Past, God Loves Man Kills, New Mutants, X-Factor and the interleaved Mutant Massacre. The order ends before Fall of the Mutants and Inferno.",
