    {
      "id": "xmen-claremont-complete",
      "name": "X-Men Expanded Reading Order: Silver Age to Claremont",
      "description": "The X-Men's original Silver Age stories lead into the Claremont years, with guest appearances and modern retellings added. Compiled by hand from a reader's outline of Comic Book Herald's guides, the route includes Amazing Adventures, Spider-Man, the Hulk, the Avengers, Captain America, the Defenders and Giant-Size Fantastic Four. The Hidden Years, Grand Design, Season One and the whole of First Class revisit the early years. X-Men Annual #1 and #2 are listed without a link, because Marvel's metadata carries that series only from #3.",
